const image='/images/ashbi/hty-foods/thanksgiving-email.webp';
---
<section class="section container email-work" aria-labelledby="campaign-project-heading">
  <a class="email-work-art" href={image} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View the full HTY email design (opens in a new tab)"><img src={image} alt="HTY Thanksgiving email design with a seasonal offer and grilled beef jerky product section" width="800" height="2024" loading="lazy" /></a>
  <div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL MARKETING / HTY FOODS</span><h2 id="campaign-project-heading">A seasonal offer.<br /><em>A clear next step.</em></h2><p>For HTY Foods, the Thanksgiving email brings the offer, promotional code and featured product into one connected design.</p><p>The red and gold campaign treatment leads into a product section with its own shopping action. It’s an example of the focused creative deliverables we can support alongside your wider marketing activity.</p><ul><li>Seasonal campaign layout</li><li>Offer and product hierarchy</li><li>Brand-consistent email creative</li></ul><p class="email-work-caption">Original email artwork from the project file. The promotion shown has ended.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.figma.com/design/NHkdoXL2dK0IZrjpBXs8Ug/HYT-Foods?node-id=5-649">View the original design ↗</a></div>
</section>
<style>
.email-work{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:clamp(30px,6vw,85px);align-items:center;padding-block:72px}.email-work-art{display:flex;justify-content:center;background:#eeeae3;border-radius:24px;padding:24px}.email-work-art img{width:min(100%,260px);height:auto;box-shadow:0 12px 28px #292c5020}.email-work h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.4rem)}.email-work p{max-width:620px;color:var(--muted)}.email-work li{margin-block:10px}.email-work ul{padding-left:20px;margin-block:24px}.email-work .email-work-caption{font-size:.78rem}.email-work .text-link{font-size:.73rem}@media(max-width:760px){.email-work{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-block:48px}.email-work-art{order:2}.email-work-art img{width:min(100%,260px)}}
</style>
